docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:5:ErgoWorks is not starting from zero. Google Ads account **9258098368** already contains a mature Consulting Search campaign (**700072710**) spending approximately **A$40,000 trailing 12 months**, with an observed range of **A$3.0k–A$4.7k per month** and approximately **20 real leads per month**. The campaign uses **Maximize Conversions with no target CPA**.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:7:Search captures existing demand; Meta must create demand that does not yet exist. In the last 90 days, GA4 property **316175981** recorded **zero paid-social activity** and only three Organic Social sessions. Paid traffic also lacks a dedicated conversion landing page and currently reaches generic WordPress service pages.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:72:Any use of awards, customer logos, the Danone name, “ASX 100,” a 5.0/63-review claim, named-company results, or similar proof is **client sign-off required**.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:232:Manual handling training remains the current spend anchor and largest verified **training-intent demand head** at **2,700 Australian searches per month** (`research/keyword-research-ahrefs-2026-07-13.md` §1). Research also identifies an approximately **3,400-searches-per-month mixed-intent certificate/course pool**, with buyer type **UNCLASSIFIED**, and an approximately **780-searches-per-month care-sector opportunity**. This aligns with the existing Manual Handling Training ad group, which accounted for **A$2,069, or 49% of Consulting Search spend, in the last 30 days**; the two expansion pockets remain gated and are not verified service fit.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:301:Use campaign-level negatives only after reviewing actual search terms. Do not apply Consulting exclusions account-wide because account **9258098368** also contains Physiotherapy.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:451:Any asset referring to awards, client names, customer logos, Danone, “ASX 100,” review ratings or quantified outcomes is **client sign-off required**.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:629:Any software screenshot, customer result or implementation metric requires validation. Client logos, Danone, “ASX 100,” awards and the 5.0/63-review claim are **client sign-off required**.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:675:Manual Handling Training should be the first variant because it is the **2,700-searches-per-month Australian demand head** and currently represents **49% of Consulting Search spend in the last 30 days**.
